        "title": "Vessel density changes in Choroid, Chorio-capillaries , Deep &amp; Superficial retinal plexues on OCTA in normal ageing &amp; various stages of Age Related Macular Degeneration",
        "authorString": "Narnaware SH, Bansal A, Bawankule PK, Raje D, Chakraborty M.",
        "authorList": {
          "author": [
            {
              "fullName": "Narnaware SH",
              "firstName": "Shilpi",
              "lastName": "Narnaware",
              "initials": "SH"
            },
            {
